---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Subtitle Kit"
  description="Free browser-based subtitle utilities for editors and localization. Privacy-first, no account required."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <h1>About Subtitle Kit</h1>
  <p>
    Subtitle Kit provides free, privacy-first tools for people who work with subtitles and
    short-form video: fix timing offsets, export dialogue text, check on-screen line length, and
    estimate narration duration.
  </p>
  <p>
    Every tool runs in your web browser. Subtitle content is not uploaded to our servers for
    processing. We host static pages on Cloudflare for speed and availability worldwide.
  </p>
  <h2>Who it is for</h2>
  <p>
    Video editors, localization freelancers, and creators publishing vertical or dubbed content who
    need quick fixes without installing desktop software.
  </p>
  <h2>Monetization &amp; support</h2>
  <p>
    The site may display advertising (Google AdSense, Monetag, PropellerAds, and/or Adsterra)
    to cover hosting costs. Tools remain free to use without an account. For privacy practices
    see our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy policy</a>.
  </p>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 2026-09-21</p>
</BaseLayout>
